t-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:4","P:4")</script><div hidden id="S:5"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/devops">DevOps</a><time dateTime="2026-11-05T09:09:14.000Z">2026-11-05</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/askmohanty-ai-engineer-starter-projects">askmohanty/ai-engineer-starter-projects</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Learn AI engineering by building: theory pages plus 13 hands-on Python projects on agents, tool calling, RAG, MCP, LangGraph, Google ADK and evals, built on real DevOps problems.</p><a href="https://github.com/askmohanty/ai-engineer-starter-projects" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/anthropic">Anthropic</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:5","P:5")</script><div hidden id="S:6"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-11-05T05:03:16.000Z">2026-11-05</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/zhiyilang-awesome-rpa-to-ai-agent">Zhiyilang/awesome-rpa-to-ai-agent</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Curated roadmap &amp; resources for RPA developers (影刀/UiBot) transitioning to LLM / AI Agent engineering. Zero-dependency tools, agent frameworks, deployment, and real competitions.</p><a href="https://github.com/Zhiyilang/awesome-rpa-to-ai-agent" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langchain">LangChain</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:6","P:6")</script><div hidden id="S:7"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-11-04T16:12:02.000Z">2026-11-04</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/amirumallawarachchi-documind-ai">AmiruMallawarachchi/documind-ai</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Multi-agent document Q&amp;A: a LangGraph critic verifies each answer against the retrieved passages before it streams. FastAPI + SSE + Next.js 16, Pinecone + MongoDB Atlas + Groq, all on free tiers.</p><a href="https://github.com/AmiruMallawarachchi/documind-ai" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:7","P:7")</script><div hidden id="S:8"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-11-04T09:28:47.000Z">2026-11-04</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/saigyoujiyuyuko96-breaker">SaigyoujiYuyuko96/breaker</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">会判断该不该打破第四面墙的角色扮演对话系统 | LangGraph · FastAPI · Vue 3</p><a href="https://github.com/SaigyoujiYuyuko96/breaker" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langchain">LangChain</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/typescript">TypeScript</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:8","P:8")</script><div hidden id="S:9"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/industry/legal">Legal</a><time dateTime="2026-11-04T00:56:42.000Z">2026-11-04</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/ai-agent-orchestrator-legal-intake-fastapi-lab">ai-agent-orchestrator/legal-intake-fastapi-lab</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">A FastAPI learning project adapting Legal Intake workflows with sync/async APIs, OpenAI integration, and planned NeMo Guardrails Python actions.</p><a href="https://github.com/ai-agent-orchestrator/legal-intake-fastapi-lab" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/openai">OpenAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langchain">LangChain</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:9","P:9")</script><div hidden id="S:a"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-11-03T09:09:51.000Z">2026-11-03</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/amareshhebbar-rootcast">amareshhebbar/RootCast</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Find the exact step where an AI agent run went wrong, and prove the fix by replay.</p><a href="https://github.com/amareshhebbar/RootCast" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/typescript">TypeScript</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:a","P:a")</script><div hidden id="S:b"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/coding">Coding</a><time dateTime="2026-11-03T06:30:51.000Z">2026-11-03</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/koushikjavvaji-precue">koushikjavvaji/PreCue</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Real-time AI voice copilot for meetings: checks the numbers you say against your own documents (RAG), alerts you on screen and whispers corrections in your earphones. Stays silent when you&#x27;re right.</p><a href="https://github.com/koushikjavvaji/PreCue" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:b","P:b")</script><div hidden id="S:c"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-11-02T06:41:15.000Z">2026-11-02</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/hyxiaoge-lingdraft">HyxiaoGe/LingDraft</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">能搜、能读、回答标来源的 AI 对话 agent。基于 LangGraph：create_agent + 自写中间件、并行子 agent、上下文压缩、Postgres 检查点和长期记忆</p><a href="https://github.com/HyxiaoGe/LingDraft" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/postgres">Postgres</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langchain">LangChain</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:c","P:c")</script><div hidden id="S:d"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/productivity">Productivity</a><time dateTime="2026-11-02T03:43:36.000Z">2026-11-02</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/krishujeniya-agyos">krishujeniya/AGYOS</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Autonomous AI Agent Frameworks, Workflow Orchestrators &amp; Engineering Skills Monorepo</p><a href="https://github.com/krishujeniya/AGYOS" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:d","P:d")</script><div hidden id="S:e"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-11-02T01:15:44.000Z">2026-11-02</time></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/show-hn-echochain-to-see-what-happens-when-llms-play-telephone">Show HN: EchoChain to see what happens when LLMs play telephone</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Hey HN Community! I created `echoChain` to explore the following phenomenon: how much data retained after LLMs exchange responses multiple times? Imagine the game of telephone but with AIs. Each model converts the response into a question, which is then answered. After several rounds, facts get mutated, details get stripped, and the answer is far removed from the initial one. `echoChain` is an OSS Python CLI that helps measure this process. It allows for multi-model testing, model rotation, trac</p><a href="https://github.com/smusali/echoChain" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">Hacker News</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:e","P:e")</script><div hidden id="S:f"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-11-01T09:58:52.000Z">2026-11-01</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/nonokomoto-hermes-voice-ios">nonokomoto/hermes-voice-ios</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">SwiftUI voice app and Linux services for a self-hosted Hermes Agent: on-device speech in, Gemini TTS out, background runs with APNs, per-answer token and cost tracking.</p><a href="https://github.com/nonokomoto/hermes-voice-ios" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span> · Self-hosted</p></li></div><script>$RS("S:f","P:f")</script><div hidden id="S:10"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-11-01T06:16:17.000Z">2026-11-01</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/gump111458785-evidence-verifier">Gump111458785/evidence-verifier</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Evidence auditing workbench and LLM sidecar: candidate-blind extraction, source replay, joint entity binding, and targeted evidence repair.</p><a href="https://github.com/Gump111458785/evidence-verifier" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:10","P:10")</script><div hidden id="S:11"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-10-31T20:07:53.000Z">2026-10-31</time><span>122<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/r238company-meu-emprego-novo">R238Company/meu-emprego-novo</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Equipe de agentes de IA (CrewAI + AWS Bedrock/Claude) que lê a descrição de uma vaga e a base profissional da pessoa e gera currículos personalizados em PDF/LaTeX, em PT ou EN, sem inventar informações e preservando toda a trajetória de carreira.</p><a href="https://github.com/R238Company/meu-emprego-novo" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/anthropic">Anthropic</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span> · AWS</p></li></div><script>$RS("S:11","P:11")</script><div hidden id="S:12"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/security">Security</a><time dateTime="2026-10-31T18:58:29.000Z">2026-10-31</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/rishabhhota19-portfolio">rishabhhota19/portfolio</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Portfolio with a Python LangGraph agent that answers recruiters: hybrid RAG (FAISS + BM25, RRF, cross-encoder re-ranking), free-LLM fallback, RAGAS evals, Next.js security gateway.</p><a href="https://github.com/rishabhhota19/portfolio" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/nextjs">Next.js</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langchain">LangChain</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/vercel">Vercel</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:12","P:12")</script><div hidden id="S:13"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/mcp">MCP server</a><time dateTime="2026-10-31T08:00:29.000Z">2026-10-31</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/ranbir1998-tripmate-ai-multi-agent-travel-planner">Ranbir1998/tripmate-ai-multi-agent-travel-planner</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Multi-agent AI travel planner powered by LangGraph, Ollama, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, and MCP integrations.</p><a href="https://github.com/Ranbir1998/tripmate-ai-multi-agent-travel-planner" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/postgres">Postgres</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:13","P:13")</script><div hidden id="S:14"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/coding">Coding</a><a href="/industry/real-estate">Real estate</a><time dateTime="2026-10-30T14:49:17.000Z">2026-10-30</time></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/show-hn-ai-agent-needs-process-to-build-a-commercial-application">Show HN: AI agent needs process to build a commercial application</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">I decided to test this claim with my app, NoMoreHappyPath (NMHP), against Claude on a real project. Here is the test: I built Acremuse, a commercial real estate analysis platform, with Claude Desktop and Codex as a reviewer. It is deployed and used today by a couple of investors. Then I wondered what I&#x27;d missed that might bite me later. ~ 374,000 Lines of program code - 1,070 Source files (Python and TypeScript) - ~ 11,400 Functions and methods - 3,067 Automated tests So I gave the same 374k-lin</p><a href="https://nomorehappypath.com/" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">Hacker News</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/anthropic">Anthropic</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/typescript">TypeScript</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:14","P:14")</script><div hidden id="S:15"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-10-30T12:36:51.000Z">2026-10-30</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/bitraguntareshma2-creator-reinforcement-learning-game">bitraguntareshma2-creator/Reinforcement-Learning-Game</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">A Tic-Tac-Toe game powered by Reinforcement Learning using the Q-Learning algorithm. The AI agent learns from rewards and penalties through thousands of training games and improves its decision-making skills. Developed using Python and NumPy.</p><a href="https://github.com/bitraguntareshma2-creator/Reinforcement-Learning-Game" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:15","P:15")</script><div hidden id="S:16"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-10-29T21:43:10.000Z">2026-10-29</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/han13ter2014-web-digital-being">han13ter2014-web/Digital_being</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Эксперимент по наблюдаемой цифровой жизни: существо с памятью, намерениями и энергией, безопасный исполнитель действий и read-only наблюдение. Python 3.10+, Windows, без LLM в жизненном контуре.</p><a href="https://github.com/han13ter2014-web/Digital_being" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:16","P:16")</script><div hidden id="S:17"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-10-29T20:37:57.000Z">2026-10-29</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/eymenarabaci-piko">eymenarabaci/piko</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Yerel CLI ajanları için kalıcı görev yönetimi, bağımlılık tabanlı planlama, kontrollü paralel yürütme ve denetimli toparlanma.</p><a href="https://github.com/eymenarabaci/piko" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:17","P:17")</script><div hidden id="S:18"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/productivity">Productivity</a><a href="/industry/developer-tools">Developer tools</a><time dateTime="2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z">2026-10-29</time></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/vercel-plugin-is-now-available-in-antigravity">Vercel Plugin is now available in Antigravity</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">The Vercel Plugin is now available in the Google Antigravity marketplace. Use the Vercel Plugin to give your Antigravity agent guidance on Vercel APIs and recommended patterns, with skills for products such as AI SDK , Vercel Functions , and Workflow . This demo shows an Antigravity agent using the Vercel Plugin to build and deploy a Python backend with Vercel Sandbox : Install the Vercel Plugin by opening Customizations → Marketplace in the Antigravity App and searching for Vercel , then see th</p><a href="https://vercel.com/changelog/vercel-plugin-is-now-available-in-antigravity" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">Vercel</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/vercel">Vercel</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span> · Vercel</p></li></div><script>$RS("S:18","P:18")</script><div hidden id="S:19"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/mcp">MCP server</a><time dateTime="2026-10-26T15:02:49.000Z">2026-10-26</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/kiant98-dsh-hoi4-modding">Kiant98/dsh-hoi4-modding</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">HOI4（钢铁雄心4）模组开发工具包：1 个模组工程师 agent、15 个技能、20 个 MCP 工具，配 153 篇参考库与以原版 1.19.4.2 为参照的知识库。纯 Python 标准库零依赖，面向 1.19.x。</p><a href="https://github.com/Kiant98/dsh-hoi4-modding" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:19","P:19")</script><div hidden id="S:1a"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/data">Data</a><time dateTime="2026-10-25T21:28:45.000Z">2026-10-25</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/darwinjcn-local-text-to-sql-agent">darwinjcn/local-text-to-sql-agent</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Agentes de IA locales y open-source para análisis de datos. Implementa arquitecturas híbridas (Python/Pandas/SQL + CrewAI + Ollama) garantizando precisión y cero alucinaciones en reportes de negocio.</p><a href="https://github.com/darwinjcn/local-text-to-sql-agent" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langchain">LangChain</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:1a","P:1a")</script><div hidden id="S:1b"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/coding">Coding</a><time dateTime="2026-10-25T16:26:46.000Z">2026-10-25</time><span>3<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/beeverforge-beeverforge-oss">BeeverForge/beeverforge-oss</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">An autonomous software factory: tickets in, reviewed pull requests out. Apache-2.0, runs on your machines, no vendor lock-in.</p><a href="https://github.com/BeeverForge/beeverforge-oss" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:1b","P:1b")</script><div hidden id="S:1c"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-10-23T11:39:24.000Z">2026-10-23</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/dijundev-agent-redteam">dijundev/agent-redteam</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Measure how unsafe your tool-using LLM agent really is — 60 prompt-injection cases × 5 toggleable defense layers, with reproducible ASR and false-positive numbers.</p><a href="https://github.com/dijundev/agent-redteam" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:1c","P:1c")</script><div hidden id="S:1d"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/mcp">MCP server</a><time dateTime="2026-10-20T15:26:37.000Z">2026-10-20</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/world-breaker-hello-agent">world-breaker/hello-agent</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">最小 ReAct Agent + 工具调用（LangGraph）：手写「模型思考 → 调用工具 → 观察结果 → 再思考」的循环，工具含经 MCP 客户端接入的 RAG 检索、计算器与当前时间。把 Agent 里最容易出问题的三件事做成显式机制：最大步数、失败重试/降级/熔断、每步 thought/action/observation 落 JSONL 的 trace。</p><a href="https://github.com/world-breaker/hello-agent" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:1d","P:1d")</script><div hidden id="S:1e"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/coding">Coding</a><time dateTime="2026-10-16T02:42:54.000Z">2026-10-16</time><span>5<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/panda-z519-agent-session-titles">panda-z519/agent-session-titles</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">一条命令为 Codex 与 Claude Code 安装三段式会话标题插件</p><a href="https://github.com/panda-z519/agent-session-titles" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/anthropic">Anthropic</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:1e","P:1e")</script><div hidden id="S:1f"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/mcp">MCP server</a><time dateTime="2026-10-13T17:27:04.000Z">2026-10-13</time><span>2<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/milkteatw1-piscout">MilkteaTW1/piscout</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Find, control and flash your Raspberry Pis from one Windows window: LAN scan, SSH terminal with suggestions, remote desktop, drag-and-drop upload, SD flashing, MCP for AI. 樹莓派一站式管理工具</p><a href="https://github.com/MilkteaTW1/piscout" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-