eading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Local-first AI agent security scanner and MCP traffic monitor. Finds prompt injection, over-privileged tools, and secrets in agent code, manifests, and prompts; records MCP tool calls with secrets masked. CLI, pre-commit, GitHub Action, SARIF, OWASP Agentic Top 10.</p><a href="https://github.com/AgentLatch/agent-latch" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langchain">LangChain</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:25","P:25")</script><div hidden id="S:26"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-09-26T19:04:10.000Z">2026-09-26</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/sigrix-io-sigrix-runtime">sigrix-io/sigrix-runtime</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">The Postern runner inside every bundle Sigrix delivers: the four verbs and the licence check, on the buyer&#x27;s own machine.</p><a href="https://github.com/sigrix-io/sigrix-runtime" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:26","P:26")</script><div hidden id="S:27"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/research">Research</a><a href="/industry/finance">Finance</a><time dateTime="2026-09-16T22:54:58.000Z">2026-09-16</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/alakbarr-monika">alakbarr/Monika</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Experimental multi-agent trading research harness for MetaTrader 5. Combines LLM market analysis with deterministic Python risk management. For research and demo testing.</p><a href="https://github.com/alakbarr/Monika" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:27","P:27")</script><div hidden id="S:28"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/mcp">MCP server</a><time dateTime="2026-09-16T10:07:45.000Z">2026-09-16</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/strategiumfinancepartner-agentnexus">Strategiumfinancepartner/AgentNexus</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Continuously verified registry of the APIs, MCP servers and CLIs that AI agents call — live health checks, reliability history, and an anonymous MCP endpoint agents can connect to without a consent screen.</p><a href="https://github.com/Strategiumfinancepartner/AgentNexus" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langchain">LangChain</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/typescript">TypeScript</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:28","P:28")</script><div hidden id="S:29"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-09-10T11:12:52.000Z">2026-09-10</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/x-10-y-rag-agent">X-10-Y/RAG-Agent</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">租房合同风险审查 Agent：LangGraph 编排 + BM25/向量混合检索 + RRF 融合 + CrossEncoder 重排，FastAPI 提供合同上传、风险报告与流式问答，附 33 条标注评测与回归基线。</p><a href="https://github.com/X-10-Y/RAG-Agent" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:29","P:29")</script><div hidden id="S:2a"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-09-09T16:39:40.000Z">2026-09-09</time><span>0<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/shashank17singh-agentic-fraud-sentinel">Shashank17singh/Agentic-Fraud-Sentinel</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">A financial fraud detection system powered by an XGBoost model. It handles severe class imbalance using SMOTE and temporal feature engineering, and provides clear, interpretable reasons for its predictions using SHAP values.</p><a href="https://github.com/Shashank17singh/Agentic-Fraud-Sentinel" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:2a","P:2a")</script><div hidden id="S:2b"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><a href="/c/mcp">MCP server</a><time dateTime="2026-09-07T17:54:51.000Z">2026-09-07</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/b1uemu3ic4m-approximately">B1ueMu3ic4m/approximately</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">Flight recorder, MAST failure attribution &amp; on-call ops loop for AI agents: replay, tamper-evident evidence, triage queue, letter grades, handoff briefs, fleet tail, price catalog. 50 MCP tools. Zero dependencies, Python 3.10+.</p><a href="https://github.com/B1ueMu3ic4m/approximately" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/mcp">MCP</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/crewai">CrewAI</a></span><span>, <a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/langgraph">LangGraph</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:2b","P:2b")</script><div hidden id="S:2c"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-09-01T09:44:47.000Z">2026-09-01</time><span>1<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/osama-syseng-oss-work-universal-ai-agent">Osama-SysEng/oss-work-universal-ai-agent</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">OS_V1 — a local-first AI agent that plans, verifies, then acts: 300 specialized agents, real tools, honest verify/heal gates. Try it in one click.</p><a href="https://github.com/Osama-SysEng/oss-work-universal-ai-agent" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><span><a class="font-semibold text-[#12151c]" href="/stack/python">Python</a></span></p></li></div><script>$RS("S:2c","P:2c")</script><div hidden id="S:2d"><li class="px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5c6570]"><time dateTime="2026-08-28T10:53:39.000Z">2026-08-28</time><span>2<!-- --> stars</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#12151c]"><a class="hover:text-[#1d4ed8]" href="/l/jiangchuangege-xiaojiao-harnees">jiangchuangege/xiaojiao-harnees</a></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5c6570]">把智力从模型搬进载体的本地 AI 助手：换模型，助手不变（记忆/人格/工具/安全边界都不丢）。用本地 4B 跑出远超参数量的效果 —— 状态在代码层真的改变行为（工具表 6→0），不是写进提示词劝它。100% 本地运行。</p><a href="https://github.com/jiangchuangege/xiaojiao-harnees" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8]">GitHub</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5c6570]"><